I_{\mathcal{A}}\right)  ,\left\{  \left.  \Phi_{\mathit{\operatorname*{tr}}%
}\left(  x_{j_{1}}\cdots x_{j_{p}}\right)  \right\vert 1\leq j_{1}%
<\cdots<j_{p}\leq2r\right\}  ;1\leq p\leq2r\right\}  $ is orthogonal i.e.
\begin{equation}
