x_{j_{p}}\right)  \right\vert \Phi_{\mathit{\operatorname*{tr}}}\left(
x_{k_{1}}\cdots x_{k_{q}}\right)  \right\rangle _{\mathcal{H}%
\mathit{\operatorname*{tr}}}=\mathit{\operatorname*{tr}}\left\{  \left(
