_{Q^{\dagger}}  &  =\operatorname*{tr}\left\{  Q\left[  H,Q\right]
Q^{\dagger}Q\right\}  =\operatorname*{tr}\left\{  Q\left(  HQ-QH\right)
Q^{\dagger}Q\right\}  =E\operatorname*{tr}\left\{  QQQ^{\dagger}Q\right\}
=0\\
&  \Rightarrow\operatorname*{tr}\left\{  HQQ^{\dagger}QQ\right\}
=\operatorname*{tr}\left\{  HQ^{\dagger}QQQ\right\} \\
