}\widehat{\mathcal{N}}_{a}\left(  a_{j}^{{}}\right)  \right\rangle
_{0}=\left\langle \left.  a_{k}^{{}}\right\vert -a_{j}^{{}}\right\rangle
=-\operatorname*{tr}\left\{  a_{k}^{\dagger}a_{j}^{{}}\right\}  =\left\{
\begin{array}
[c]{c}%
